RUN: mkdir -p %t.d
RUN: %PLC --constructors-only --relocatable --fpic %S/properties_c_lib.pli -o %t.d/ctors.o
RUN: cc -shared -fPIC %S/properties_c_lib.c %t.d/ctors.o -o %t.d/libfbext.so
RUN: %COMPILE -i %S/properties_c_lib.pli %S/properties_c_main.st -L%t.d -lfbext
RUN: env LD_LIBRARY_PATH=%STDLIBDIR:%t.d %t.out | %CHECK %s

FbExt is a library FB: properties_c_lib.c implements its bodies and property
accessors, and --constructors-only generates its constructors. The program
includes properties_c_lib.pli and must call the library accessors, not define
its own.

CHECK: 42
CHECK: 42
